OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CJason Arday research cleared following 
OL,5,CQueen's University investigation       
OL,6,GResearch by academic Jason Arday, who  
OL,7,Gwas accused of plagiarism before his   
OL,8,Gdeath, has been cleared by one of the  
OL,9,Ginstitutions that was investigating    
OL,10,Ghim.                                   
OL,12,FQueen's University Belfast (QUB) began 
OL,13,Flooking into Jason Arday's work after  
OL,14,Fhe resigned from his University of     
OL,15,FCambridge roles.                       
OL,17,FThe university had published a paper   
OL,18,Fon its academic research site co-      
OL,19,Fauthored by Arday and other academics  
OL,20,Ffrom Queen's in 2021.                  
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
