OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CUK Town of Culture bid withdrawn in    
OL,5,CStrabane after it causes 'great        
OL,6,Cdivision'                              
OL,7,GA competition that is supposed to      
OL,8,Gcelebrate local towns has been         
OL,9,Grejected by a council after it caused  
OL,10,G"great division" over its UK title.    
OL,12,FThe mainly-nationalist town of         
OL,13,FStrabane in County Tyrone was          
OL,14,Fshortlisted as one of 15 possible      
OL,15,Flocations for the inaugural UK Town of 
OL,16,FCulture 2028, with the chance to win   
OL,17,F#3m.                                   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
