OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CMan accused of murdering Chloe         
OL,5,CMitchell lied repeatedly, court hears  
OL,6,GThis article contains details that     
OL,7,Gsome may find distressing              
OL,9,FA man accused of murdering Chloe       
OL,10,FMitchell killed her before "lying      
OL,11,Frepeatedly" to police, a court has     
OL,12,Fbeen told.                             
OL,14,FBrandon Rainey, formerly of James      
OL,15,FStreet in Ballymena, denies a charge   
OL,16,Fof murder and a charge of preventing   
OL,17,Fthe lawful burial of her remains.      
OL,19,FThe 30-year-old defendant sat in the   
OL,20,Fdock in Belfast Crown Court wearing a  
OL,21,Fgrey tracksuit and flanked by two      
OL,22,Fprison officers.                  G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
