OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CSacked police officer showed 'all the  
OL,5,Challmarks of predatory behaviour'      
OL,6,GA police officer has been sacked after 
OL,7,Gsending sexualised messages to a       
OL,8,Gvulnerable woman whose harassment      
OL,9,Gcomplaint he was investigating.        
OL,11,FHe also failed to properly investigate 
OL,12,Fcounter-allegations made by her ex-    
OL,13,Fpartner, a Police Ombudsman            
OL,14,Finvestigation has found.               
OL,16,FHugh Hume, chief executive of the      
OL,17,FPolice Ombudsman's Office, said the    
OL,18,Fofficer had shown "all the hallmarks   
OL,19,Fof predatory behaviour".               
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
